Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Gnomeregan \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 31-34 Gnomeregan]
[NX 31-42 Scarlet Monastery Armory]

-- Alliance: Stormwind, then by tram to Ironforge, Kharanos and the Gnomeregan entrance.
[A Alliance] In the Dwarven District, Shoni the Shilent gives [QA2928 Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators] [G62.6,34.1 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge [G72.0,27.6 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Leave the tram into Tinker Town [G84.1,53.1 Ironforge] \\ Boborus Overvolt (level 53) in Tinker Town may attack.
[A Alliance] Tinkmaster Overspark gives [QA2922 Save Techbot's Brain!] [G69.5,50.3 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] High Tinker Mekkatorque gives [QA2929 The Grand Betrayal] [G68.8,49.0 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Master Mechanic Castpipe gives [QA2930 Data Rescue] [G69.8,48.1 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Klockmort Spannerspan gives [QA2924 Essential Artificials] [G67.9,46.1 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Leave Ironforge by the main gate [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Go south-west down to Kharanos [G45.9,49.4 Dun Morogh] \\ A Plague Zombie (level 50) may be near the gate, and Edan the Howler (elite, level 9) near the road.
[A Alliance] Ozzie Togglevolt gives [QA2926 Gnogaine] [G45.9,49.4 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Head west to the Gnomeregan entrance [G24.3,39.8 Dun Morogh] \\ Ride the elevator down; the next steps are in the tunnels below. Timber (elite, level 10) may roam on the way, and an Addled Leper (level 40) may stand at the entrance.
[A Alliance] In the tunnels, use the Empty Leaden Collection Phial on a living Irradiated Invader [QC2926 Gnogaine] [G20.9,36.0 Dun Morogh] \\ Irradiated Invaders are elite, level 24-26.
[O][A Alliance] [QC2930 Data Rescue] Kill Caverndeep Invaders, Looters, Pillagers, Irradiated Invaders or Addled Lepers until one drops a White Punch Card [G21.8,33.1 Dun Morogh] \\ All but the Lepers are elite, level 24-26.
[O][A Alliance] [QC2930 Data Rescue] Put the White Punch Card into Matrix Punchograph 3005-A for the Yellow Punch Card [G22.0,32.6 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Kill Techbot (elite, level 26) for its memory core [QC2922 Save Techbot's Brain!] [G19.8,31.9 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Ride the elevator up and go back east to Kharanos [G24.3,39.8 Dun Morogh][G45.9,49.4 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Ozzie Togglevolt: turn in [QT2926 Gnogaine] and accept [QA2962 The Only Cure is More Green Glow] [G45.9,49.4 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Back west to the Gnomeregan entrance; ride the elevator down and keep left through the tunnels to the portal [G24.3,39.8 Dun Morogh]

-- Horde: Orgrimmar, then by way of Ratchet and the boat to Booty Bay, and Scooty's transporter.
[A Horde] In the Valley of Honor, Nogg gives [QA2841 Rig Wars] [G76.0,25.4 Orgrimmar] \\ Take it before you speak to Sovik: once you hold Chief Engineer Scooty, Rig Wars is no longer offered.
[A Horde] Sovik, next to Nogg, gives [QA2842 Chief Engineer Scooty] [G75.5,25.4 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Go to Doras, the flight master [P Orgrimmar] [G45.1,63.9 Orgrimmar] \\ An Incubus (level 20-30) may be on the way.
[A Horde] Fly to the Crossroads [F Crossroads] [G51.5,30.3 The Barrens] \\ An Incubus (level 20-30) may be by the flight master.
[A Horde] Run south-east across the plain to Ratchet, and learn the flight point at Bragok [P Ratchet] [G59.0,34.0 The Barrens][G63.1,37.2 The Barrens] \\ If you already know Ratchet, fly straight there instead.
[A Horde] Walk to the end of the Ratchet pier and take the boat to Booty Bay [G63.7,38.5 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, level 20) near the pier and the Ratchet Enforcers (level 57) may attack.
[A Horde] Leave the boat and follow the boardwalk round the bay [G26.1,73.4 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.0,74.6 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.1,76.6 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ The Booty Bay Enforcers (level 57) may attack.
[A Horde] At Gringer, the flight master, learn the flight point [P Booty Bay] [G26.9,77.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Make Booty Bay your home at Innkeeper Skindle [S Booty Bay] [G27.0,77.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Scooty: turn in [QT2842 Chief Engineer Scooty] and accept [QA2843 Gnomer-gooooone!] [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Wait while Scooty calibrates the transporter [QC2843 Gnomer-gooooone!] [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Turn in [QT2843 Gnomer-gooooone!] for the Goblin Transponder [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Step onto the transporter platform by Scooty with the Goblin Transponder in your bags; it takes you to Gnomeregan. Enter the instance portal.

-- Left out: 2923, 2925, 2927 and 2931 are optional lead-ins to 2922, 2924, 2926 and 2930.
-- Left out: the 4601-4606 copies of the Sparklematic quests are duplicates; 80325 shows no giver or start item in the data, to check in game.
-- Left out for Alliance: 2904 A Fine Mess ends in Booty Bay, far off the Alliance road, and the guide cannot assume a known Booty Bay flight point.
Inside Gnomeregan:
[A Alliance] [QC2928 Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators] Collect 24 Robo-mechanical Guts; many foes inside drop them.
[A Alliance] [QC2924 Essential Artificials] Collect 12 Essential Artificials from the Artificial Extrapolators.
[A Alliance] [QC2930 Data Rescue] Use each Matrix Punchograph in turn (3005-B, -C, then -D) with your newest card, to end with the Prismatic Punch Card.
[A Alliance] [QC2962 The Only Cure is More Green Glow] Use the Heavy Leaden Collection Phial on living Irradiated Slimes, Corrosive Lurkers or Irradiated Horrors to collect High Potency Radioactive Fallout; it may take several tries. The fallout does not keep long, so hand it in soon after.
Dark Iron Agents may drop a Grime-Encrusted Ring: right-click it to start [QA2945 Grime-Encrusted Ring]
Grime-Encrusted Objects drop from many foes inside. At The Sparklematic 5200 in the Clean Zone, accept and turn in [QA2951 The Sparklematic 5200!] [QT2951 The Sparklematic 5200!] with 3 silver and one object.
At The Sparklematic 5200, once 2951 is done, accept and turn in [QA2952 The Sparklematic 5200!] [QT2952 The Sparklematic 5200!]
If you have another Grime-Encrusted Object, accept and turn in [QA2953 More Sparklematic Action] [QT2953 More Sparklematic Action] at The Sparklematic 5200
If you have the ring, turn in [QT2945 Grime-Encrusted Ring] at The Sparklematic 5200 too, then accept [A Alliance] [QA2947 Return of the Ring] [A Horde] [QA2949 Return of the Ring]
[A Horde] Kernobee, inside, gives [QA2904 A Fine Mess]: escort him to the Clockwerk Run exit [QC2904 A Fine Mess]
[A Horde] Kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg for Thermaplugg's Safe Combination [QC2841,2 Rig Wars]
[A Horde] Open Thermaplugg's Safe in his room for the Rig Blueprints [QC2841,1 Rig Wars]
[A Alliance] Kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg [QC2929 The Grand Betrayal]

-- Alliance turn-ins: Kharanos, Ironforge, then Stormwind.
[A Alliance] Leave Gnomeregan, ride the elevator up and go east to Kharanos [G24.3,39.8 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2962 The Only Cure is More Green Glow] to Ozzie Togglevolt [G45.9,49.4 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Follow the road back north-east to the Ironforge gate [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2924 Essential Artificials] to Klockmort Spannerspan [G67.9,46.1 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2930 Data Rescue] to Master Mechanic Castpipe [G69.8,48.1 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2929 The Grand Betrayal] to High Tinker Mekkatorque [G68.8,49.0 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2922 Save Techbot's Brain!] to Tinkmaster Overspark [G69.5,50.3 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] In the Mystic Ward, turn in [QT2947 Return of the Ring] to Talvash del Kissel [G36.4,3.6 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] If you have a Silver Bar, a Moss Agate and 30 silver, accept and turn in [QA2948 Gnome Improvement] [QT2948 Gnome Improvement] [G36.4,3.6 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Take the Deeprun Tram back to Stormwind [G84.1,53.1 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] Leave the tram in the Dwarven District [G72.0,27.6 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT2928 Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators] to Shoni the Shilent [G62.6,34.1 Stormwind City]

-- Horde turn-ins: Booty Bay, then Orgrimmar.
[A Horde] Hearth to Booty Bay [H]
[A Horde] Turn in [QT2904 A Fine Mess] to Scooty [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Follow the boardwalk round the bay to the dock and take the boat to Ratchet [G28.1,76.6 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.0,74.6 Stranglethorn Vale][G26.1,73.4 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Go to the flight master [G63.7,38.5 The Barrens][G63.1,37.2 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Fly to Orgrimmar, by way of the Crossroads [F Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Turn in [QT2841 Rig Wars] and [QT2949 Return of the Ring] to Nogg [G45.1,63.9 Orgrimmar][G76.0,25.4 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] If you have a Silver Bar, a Moss Agate and 30 silver, accept and turn in [QA2950 Nogg's Ring Redo] [QT2950 Nogg's Ring Redo] [G76.0,25.4 Orgrimmar]
